From: Juansolo457 <5344231+Juansolo457@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 15:31:57 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add in_joystickXenon: the Xbox 360 build's controller feel

Recovered from the Quake 4 Xbox 360 default.xex:
- stick: round gate stretched to a square, then per-axis XInput dead zones
  (7849 left, 8689 right) with a linear rescale to +/-127 (0x822B6030, 0x822B5F68)
- look: three-segment acceleration curve (x<.25: .3x; to .75: slope .6; then 2.5),
  two-sample smoothing that resets when the stick centres, m_yaw .0253 /
  m_pitch .0209 degrees per unit per 60 Hz tic, zoomed 30% (0x821C9AA8, 0x821C9A08)
- triggers: pressed above 64/255, no hysteresis

in_xenonYawScale/PitchScale/ZoomedSlow/LookCurve/Smoothing expose the tuning.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
